  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0043_48eca01e7ff0.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.87986in;height:1.08681in\" /><br />From diagram mid-point of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> must lie on the plane<br /><math><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is perpendicular to the required plane<br />Direction ratios of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo></math><br />Equation of the required plane is<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br />The perpendicular distance from the origin to the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units"
